meta {
  name: get component
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}library/components/:id/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 1
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Component detail page (FR-1.11). Any role. Adds `stock_by_location`, `projects`
  (net quantity consumed per project, with estimated value = quantity x last
  buying price) and `requisitions`. The full movement history is at
  inventory/movements/list movements with `?component=<id>`.


  ## API example response
  {
    "id": 1,
